WEBVTT

00:01:29.961 --> 00:01:33.129
For a regular set that might be 12 songs,

00:01:33.153 --> 00:01:34.695
myself and a team,

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:38.443
we have to study over 30 songs
or more for one set

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:40.884
and hope and pray
we have the right setlist.

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:42.980
But you know what?

00:01:43.004 --> 00:01:44.377
You know what the reward is?

00:01:44.401 --> 00:01:45.925
Looking down in the audience

00:01:45.949 --> 00:01:48.757
and seeing Deaf
and hard-of-hearing members,

00:01:48.781 --> 00:01:51.750
all of those people dancing
and jamming out

00:01:51.774 --> 00:01:56.154
and feeling included
in that music experience.

00:01:57.487 --> 00:02:01.090
For myself, I'm a part of this cultural
and linguistic community,